facet.library/GetFenceStatus                      facet.library/GetFenceStatus

   NAME
	GetFenceStatus -- Whether a fence is signalled, without waiting.

   SYNOPSIS
	    fn GetFenceStatus(base: *FacetBase, device: *facet.Device, fence: *facet.Fence) facet.Result

   SINCE
	1.0. LVO -188.

